  "notes": "S020b adds bounded library.search/read over immutable licensed text/CSV assets and a new operator-provisioned image containing FFmpeg/ffprobe. All 25 capabilities remain container-tier and network/GPU-free; older image/world versions are unchanged. Media is generated/edited by Python programs using installed FFmpeg, never by hosted or local AI in this slice. Existing explicit experiment grants and data-only lineage remain authoritative. S021a adds optional models.list/models.ask through the supervisor, without sandbox network or GPU devices. Requires local-models-v1 specialist configuration and explicit model permissions. No visual AI or autonomous specialist loops.",
